WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.625
Finish Claude setup, then open
Accessibility settings from the chat.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:07.583
Turn on Handy AI
and return to the app.

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:11.208
Use screen-reading example
fills this prompt for you.

00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:14.792
Read the prompt and make any edits
before starting.

00:00:14.792 --> 00:00:17.458
Use a screen you are
comfortable sharing.

00:00:17.458 --> 00:00:21.458
When you are ready, tap Start,
the round button at the right.
